---
const { detail = false } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="container runefjord-spotlight" aria-labelledby="runefjord-title"><div class="runefjord-copy"><p class="eyebrow">NEXT GAME / STRATEGIC SLOTH ORIGINAL</p><span class="status neutral">In testing · Android</span><h2 id="runefjord-title">A little merge.<br>A whole fjord of treasure.</h2><p>Runefjord is our Viking sticker merge game. Merge stickers, collect their shiny versions, and fill painted scenes from a harbour feast to a wyrm’s lair. It is built on Tropic Tumble, with a new world on top. Designed and built end to end by Remi Couture.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href={detail ? "#play" : "/runefjord/"} data-track="product_click" data-track-product="runefjord">{detail ? "Try the browser demo ↓" : "Discover Runefjord ↗"}</a><a class="text-link" href="/tropic-tumble/" data-track="product_click" data-track-product="tropic-tumble">See Tropic Tumble ↗</a></div><p class="runefjord-publisher">A Strategic Sloth LLC game. Coming to Google Play.</p></div><a class="runefjord-art" href="/runefjord/" aria-label="Explore Runefjord"><img class="runefjord-logo" src="/media/runefjord/logo.webp" alt="Runefjord" width="900" height="576" loading="lazy"/><div class="runefjord-phones"><img src="/media/runefjord/shot-1-merge.webp" alt="Runefjord sticker merge board" width="540" height="960" loading="lazy"/><img src="/media/runefjord/shot-3-home.webp" alt="The Runefjord home screen" width="540" height="960" loading="lazy"/></div></a></section>
<style>.runefjord-spotlight{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:50px;align-items:center;margin-block:45px 65px;padding:40px;background:#e8ecef;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px}.runefjord-copy h2{margin:22px 0;font-size:clamp(32px,3.4vw,48px)}.runefjord-copy>p:not(.eyebrow){font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;max-width:520px}.runefjord-copy .hero-actions{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px 22px}.runefjord-copy .runefjord-publisher{font-size:11px!important;margin-top:20px}.runefjord-art{padding:24px;background:#1d3550;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}.runefjord-logo{width:230px;margin:0 auto 15px}.runefjord-phones{display:flex;gap:16px;justify-content:center;align-items:center}.runefjord-phones img{width:40%;border-radius:15px;box-shadow:0 12px 25px #0006}.runefjord-phones img:nth-child(2){transform:translateY(12px)}@media(max-width:800px){.runefjord-spotlight{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:30px;padding:25px}.runefjord-art{max-width:550px;width:100%;justify-self:center}}</style>
